@startuml book_similarity_calculation
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false

title 书籍相似度计算流程 - 每日凌晨3点自动执行

database "MySQL" as db {
  frame "用户行为表"
  frame "书籍相似度表"
}

component "Java服务" as java {
  [SimilarityCalculator] as sc
  [PythonScriptExecutor] as pse
}

component "Python脚本" as python {
  [book_similarity_calculator.py] as script
}

sc --> db : 1. 查询用户行为数据
sc --> pse : 2. 传递JSON数据
pse --> script : 3. 调用Python脚本
script --> pse : 4. 返回相似度结果
sc --> db : 5. 存储相似度结果

note right of script
  计算流程:
  1. 构建物品-用户矩阵
  2. 计算余弦相似度
  3. 过滤低分结果
end note

@enduml